decented-signet
===============

Parts of this crate were ported from an earlier game codebase by the same
author (MIT licence, below), at source commit
bdd4fe877acf3a6f4ca3174d1ce79c6672935e2f:

  its Signet contacts wire module, with vectors   -> src/contacts_wire/ (copied unchanged; header
                                                      comments edited)
  its vendored NIP-46 client                        -> src/nip46.rs (URI builder, connect secret,
                                                      constant-time echo check, persisted session,
                                                      tests; the rust-nostr NostrConnect transport
                                                      replaced by a request loop on this crate's
                                                      relay trait; `perms` added to the URI)
  its server attestation and runtime identity code  -> src/attestation.rs (mint/verify; the runtime key
                                                      is bound by `p`, NIP-40 expiration added)
  its Signet contacts store, ack wait, sync and
  pairing flow                                      -> src/contacts.rs (grant, snapshot, ack gates,
                                                      projection accept; engine coupling removed)
  its rendezvous relay client                       -> src/relay.rs (websocket worker pattern,
                                                      rewritten for stored events and NIP-01 filters)

The vendored NIP-46 client is a mirror of forgesworn/signet-nip46-client
(canonical commit 5b85902f4655e541d4c631da5bc3257868dcc96a, plus the earlier
codebase's nostrconnect-secret divergence). The contacts wire is a port of
forgesworn/signet-contacts; its conformance vectors are byte-for-byte copies
taken at upstream commit fbb13cdeefb3e07421228ab3245b7e17e403ecab.

